{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to 8 players in this physics-based, mixed online/local multiplayer slime battling game. The goal is simple, eat food to get bigger and then eat the other players. Enjoy a wide variety of themed levels, interactive physical obstacles and dynamic abilities that combine to create unique experiences every time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143740/extras/6c20a2ab9cd999b348fc0b33aaacd3d0.webp?t=1759238940\" width=616 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143740/extras/604be47b3b01665d9266164b73c7e39a.poster.avif?t=1759238940\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143740/extras/604be47b3b01665d9266164b73c7e39a.webm?t=1759238940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slip, slop and slap around the arena with super satisfying visuals and controls that are easy to learn but hard to master </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143740/extras/b0c96acdd7db6790c89469e544c1fc76.webp?t=1759238940\" width=616 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143740/extras/d2e7bfee7b636b1c83336dbeb1c5b06c.poster.avif?t=1759238940\" width=616 height=417 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143740/extras/d2e7bfee7b636b1c83336dbeb1c5b06c.webm?t=1759238940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat food to grow! Body slam into slime balls to suck them up as you grow from a cute drop of slime into a massive monster</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143740/extras/5d1dfcad08c0635b0fcb14183bd659e5.webp?t=1759238940\" width=616 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143740/extras/1f9a93feca1f5433a8b83188b1bb2980.poster.avif?t=1759238940\" width=616 height=123 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143740/extras/1f9a93feca1f5433a8b83188b1bb2980.webm?t=1759238940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Latch on and drag food away to take it all for yourself, but watch out! The extra weight slows you down and can become a ball and chain...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143740/extras/2410bb1a57644969a39c3a3df19deb00.webp?t=1759238940\" width=616 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143740/extras/5bca4b959bac47494d2c99549e50d096.poster.avif?t=1759238940\" width=616 height=147 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143740/extras/5bca4b959bac47494d2c99549e50d096.webm?t=1759238940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The '<i>Sliming-Order'</i> dictates that anyone bigger than you is dangerous and anyone smaller is food.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143740/extras/95f09726d1d206814f32aabc564ff0a9.webp?t=1759238940\" width=616 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143740/extras/ce7e8c0b195b6f64c023b5d21f38d9bd.poster.avif?t=1759238940\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143740/extras/ce7e8c0b195b6f64c023b5d21f38d9bd.webm?t=1759238940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eaten players are trapped inside until they are broken free or one slime remains</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3143740?t=1759238940","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3143740?t=1759238940","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143740/558d1cc4daca11332b41a1126f5166df6c770750/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759238940","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143740/558d1cc4daca11332b41a1126f5166df6c770750/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759238940","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","i